Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:40.13,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}Has something changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.31,0:01:45.83,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}It's an inner strength you find hard to define
