Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:49.13,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}It's here somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.18,0:01:51.34,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}Maybe this is your …
