Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:57.69,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}Rise up with the Dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:01.70,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Stop could be your big win
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.70,0:02:03.62,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}It's right there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:05.59,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}For you to grab your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:08.24,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to become
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:11.78,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}Whatever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.24,op,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to Move On
